  "title": "Taweez against Mange, Furuncle & Herpes",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is also reported to overlay the ailed organ with henna and hair-removing powder for those suffering from mange, furuncle, and herpes. For the same diseases, it is reported to recite, write down, and hang on the diseased person the following holy verses and supplicatory statement:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ وَ مَثَلُ كَلِمَةٍ خَبِيْثَةٍ كَشَجَرَةٍ خَبِيْثَةٍ اجْتُثَّتْ مِنْ فَوْقِ الْاَرْضِ مَا لَهَا مِنْ قَرَارٍ مِنْهَا خَلَقْنَاكُمْ وَ فِيْهَا نُعِيْدُكُمْ وَ مِنْهَا نُخْرِجُكُمْ تَارَةً اُخْرٰى اَللهُ اَكْبَرُ وَ اَنْتَ لَا تُكَبَّرُ اَللهُ يَبْقٰى وَ اَنْتَ لَا تَبْقٰى وَاللّٰهُ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEMI WA MASALU KALIMATIN KHABEESATIN KASHAJARATIN KHABEESATINIJTUSSAT MIN FAWQIL ARZI MAA LAHAA MIN QARAARIN MINHAA KHALAQNAAKUM WA FEEHAA NU'EEDUKUM WA MINHAA NUKHRIJUKUM TAARATAN UKHRAA ALLAAHU AKBARU WA ANTA LAA TUKABBARU ALLAAHU YABQAA WA ANTA LAA TABQAA WAL LAAHU A'LAA KULLI SHAY-IN QADEER.\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. And the parable of an evil word is as an evil tree pulled up from the earth's surface; it has no stability. From it We created you, and into it We shall send you back, and from it We will raise you a second time. Allah is the Most Great, and you are not made great; Allah remains, and you do not remain; and Allah has power over all things."
}
